`=TIME(HOUR(A1)+(MINUTE(A1)/60), (MINUTE(A1)%60)/6, 0)`

Replace `A1` with the cell containing the hourly measurement. This formula will return a time value representing the first 10-minute interval of the hour. You can then copy this formula down to create a series of time values representing each 10-minute interval of the hour.

