To ensure confidentiality and security of patient data, doctors can use MATLAB to develop and implement electronic health record (EHR) systems. These systems can store and manage patient information securely, while also allowing for easy access by authorized personnel.

Here is an example of MATLAB code that could be used to create an EHR system:
```matlab
% Define patient structure
struct Patient
    name;
    age;
    gender;
